{"c":{"162041":["Kai Miura","Male","b162041-QeoQ8wXZvLYR.jpg","He is a boy who stands out due to his lemon colored hair and pierced ears, and he became the center of a group of popular people. He acts coldly to almost everyone, but for some reason he cares about Uka.",305],"182176":["Uka Ishimori","Female","b182176-nGN3nvAyEv7l.jpg","In middle school she was given the nickname \"stone\" and afterwards she became a withdrawn girl who had forgotten how to cry or laugh. By coincidence, she met Kai after enrolling at Hachimitsu High School.",309],"245534":["Ayumi Endou","Female","b245534-Qa4oFsLNIblx.png","Uka's first friend with a cheerful and friendly personality. She has had a crush on Satoru since kindergarten.",71],"245535":["Satoru Seto","Male","b245535-zubxiBXbIkxl.jpg","Kai's friend and a mood maker. He is close childhood friends with Ayumi and is oblivious to romance.",20],"245536":["Tomoya Takamine","Male","b245536-8jwUYvfq6vKs.png","Kai's friend. He is always smiling, but has a mysterious side where no one knows what he is thinking.",26],"245537":["Serina Kanno","Female","b245537-yiXtIbTp3lJq.png","Kai's ex-girlfriend. She became famous starting from the entrance ceremony, with an amazing physique everyone wants.",66],"245716":["Yuru Hashimoto","Female","b245716-Pw5zUVQWAI6x.png","A friend of Uka and Ayumi's.",5],"245876":["Marin Fujita","Female","b245876-p74raDAL2HPn.jpg","One of Uka's classmates.",2],"245877":["Moka Shiraishi","Female","b245877-0mCNlGhCigfx.jpg","One of Uka's classmates.",1],"245878":["Tao Oikawa","Female","b245878-aUKBE4N9cLPl.jpg","One of Uka's classmates.",3],"245987":["Remi Kojima","Female","b245987-0MyJc5APo8wl.jpg","A girl who used to bully Uka.",0],"393318":["Uka's Mom","Female","b393318-X4lyWPn4M8b3.jpg","Uka's mother.",0],"393319":["Kenjitsu Ishimori","Male","b393319-ptXkjb5LoMgM.jpg","Uka's overprotective father.",0],"393320":["Natsumi","Female","b393320-JSFQLXRMeV11.jpg","",0],"393321":["Nagano","Female","b393321-UoIXfwMLuj1m.jpg